: 1,0:01:29.69,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:01:29.69,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:01:29.71,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:01:29.76,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,cDialogue: 1,0:01:29.77,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.79,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:01:29.84,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:01:29.86,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:29.86,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,yDialogue: 0,0:01:29.86,0:01:34.65,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,and keep on going through the hard knock days.Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.86,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:01:30.06,0:01:30.40,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.06,0:01:30.56,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.31,0:01:30.65,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,muDialogue: 2,0:01:30.56,0:01:30.94,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,beDialogue: 2,0:01:30.65,0:01:31.19,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kiDialogue: 2,0:01:30.94,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,hardDialogue: 2,0:01:31.37,0:01:31.98,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,knockDialogue: 2,0:01:31.67,0:01:34.65,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,daysDialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:45.78,Title,,0,0,240,,Sabo's AdventureDialogue: 0,0:01:45.80,0:01:50.27,Captions,,0,0,240,,Dressrosa A Hill in the Eastern Town of CartaDialogue: 0,0:01:55.14,0:01:57.82,Captions,,0,0,175,,Kyros' HouseDialogue: 0,0:02:01.88,0:02:04.25,Main,,0,0,0,,So you met him while with the Revolutionary Army?Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.25,0:02:04.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes.Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.60,0:02:06.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.17,0:02:08.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin, you don't have to wake him.Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.26,0:02:11.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I just came to see his face before I set off.Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.02,0:02:17.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you leaving the country already?Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.79,0:02:21.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Trouble's headed this way.Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.75,0:02:23.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What kind of trouble?Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.08,0:02:24.26,Main,,0,0,0,,CP-0.Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.74,0:02:31.82,Main,,0,0,0,,They played a part in Doflamingo's deception scheme.Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.94,0:02:52.80,Main,,0,0,0,,And they're targeting us.Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:03:01.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Dressrosa's gonna get busy in a day or two.Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.56,0:03:04.36,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys should also leave as soon as possible.Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.32,0:03:07.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for telling us.Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.70,0:03:11.68,Main,,0,0,0,,And what's more, I didn't know he had another brother besides Ace.Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:14.37,Main,,0,0,0,,For real, this is the first I've heard of it.Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.37,0:03:15.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I bet.Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.46,0:03:18.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I think it surprised Luffy the most.Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.34,0:03:22.50,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.50,0:03:26.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I was presumed dead for a long time.Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:32.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I was always with Luffy and Ace when I was a kid.Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.46,0:03:38.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Running around with wild abandon, being disciplined by that old man, Garp,Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:41.08,Main,,0,0,0,,dreaming about becoming pirates...Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.44,0:03:59.30,Main,,0,0,0,,And we exchanged cups of sake and became brothers.Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.60,0:04:08.10,Main,,0,0,0,,But one day, I was involved in an accident.Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.10,0:04:10.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, an incident.Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.38,0:04:14.52,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Ace! Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.52,0:04:17.60,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,There's something wrong with this town! They're all mad!Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:23.63,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,They all know people are going to die, but they're acting like nothing's wrong. They're even smiling!Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.63,0:04:25.81,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be in this town!Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.81,0:04:27.66,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I have to tell them as soon as possible!Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:33.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace! Luffy! Run!Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.76,0:04:44.84,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to you, young boy?Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.80,0:04:57.03,Main,,0,0,0,,This town smells worse than the Gray Terminal!Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.64,0:05:01.41,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the disgusting stench of rotten people!Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:08.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll never be free if I stay here!Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.62,0:05:20.16,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Ace... Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.86,0:05:24.22,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I really want to see you...Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:27.88,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This place is like a bird cage...Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.66,0:05:34.52,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if I can bear living in this kingdom, breathing this stale air.Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.38,0:05:42.90,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Just what... is freedom?Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.82,0:05:45.52,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Where can I find it?Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.94,0:06:00.60,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Ace... Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.86,0:06:05.21,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Somebody... help me...Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.21,0:06:06.32,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Help...Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.48,0:06:27.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Vyou're late, Dragon!Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:30.26,Main,,0,0,0,,How long did vyou plan to keep vus waiting?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:31.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry.Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.24,0:06:33.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Vyou... What's that?Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.28,0:06:38.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-This is awful!Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.23,0:06:41.31,Main,,0,0,0,,You! Quickly, bring a doctor! This is an emergency!Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.31,0:06:43.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Call the ship's doctor, quickly!Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.82,0:06:49.18,Main,,0,0,0,,He's awake!Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.62,0:06:52.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Please don't shock him.Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.31,0:06:54.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Vi wasn't trying to do that!Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.75,0:06:56.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, vyou're so rude!Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.96,0:07:01.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.66,0:07:04.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Where am I?Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:06.75,Main,,0,0,0,,You're on board our ship.Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:14.41,Main,,0,0,0,,It says "Sabo" on your possessions. Is that your name?Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.98,0:07:16.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo?Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.68,0:07:18.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Dunno.Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.61,0:07:22.40,Main,,0,0,0,,"Dunno"? So what is vyour name, then?Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.50,0:07:26.12,Main,,0,0,0,,No idea...Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.12,0:07:28.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he's...Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.05,0:07:29.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Most likely.Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:34.80,Main,,0,0,0,,He still hasn't regained his memories?Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.80,0:07:37.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Indeed, not even his own name.Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.29,0:07:42.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I first met him in High Town, Goa Kingdom.Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.79,0:07:46.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm certain he's one of the nobles from there.Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.21,0:07:49.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, let's take him home then. Search for his parents...Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:53.67,Main,,0,0,0,,No...Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.67,0:07:55.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna go back!Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.27,0:07:56.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.82,0:07:58.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I dunno!Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.56,0:08:00.71,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.71,0:08:04.25,Main,,0,0,0,,that's the last thing I want!Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.25,0:08:08.34,Main,,0,0,0,,So you've had amnesia up until two years ago?Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.34,0:08:09.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.22,0:08:12.88,Main,,0,0,0,,If it was that serious, just how did you get your memory back?Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:15.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace helped me.Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.06,0:08:19.54,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what I think, anyway.Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.42,0:08:20.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire Fist Ace DiesDialogue: 0,0:08:22.38,0:08:24.96,Main,,0,0,0,,The timing couldn't have been any worse, but...Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:31.40,Main,,0,0,0,,That was how...Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.99,0:08:34.38,Main,,0,0,0,,...he woke me up.Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.41,0:08:47.10,Captions,,0,0,240,,Baltigo Revolutionary Army General HeadquartersDialogue: 0,0:08:51.38,0:08:52.69,Main,,0,0,0,,It's so hectic.Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.69,0:08:55.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Chief Sabo! You came at the right time!Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.39,0:08:57.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Report to the situation room at once!Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.21,0:09:01.80,Main,,0,0,0,,The Paramount War between the Navy and the Whitebeard Pirates has ended!Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.16,0:09:05.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard lost?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.23,0:09:07.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Is Iva-san alright?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.37,0:09:10.01,Main,,0,0,0,,He's not listed among the casualties.Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.01,0:09:12.05,Main,,0,0,0,,The dead include...Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:15.39,Main,,0,0,0,,The Emperor, Whitebeard...Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.39,0:09:16.89,Main,,0,0,0,,and...Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.89,0:09:18.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire Fist Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.04,0:09:28.14,Main,,0,0,0,,But more importantly, Dragon-san, this here...Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.14,0:09:32.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it true? Is Straw Hat Luffy your son?Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.76,0:09:33.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmm?Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.70,0:09:34.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes.Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.38,0:10:00.92,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna become a pirate...Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:10.00,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,...defeat everyone in my way, and be known worldwide!Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.96,0:10:13.65,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,That'll be proof enough that I once lived!Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.54,0:10:36.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo-kun, what's wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.48,0:10:40.48,Main,,0,0,0,,You're acting weird!Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.46,0:10:53.05,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Have you heard?Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.82,0:10:58.24,Main,,0,0,0,,They say Akainu punched a hole right through his body!Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:07.82,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,When you exchange sake cups, you become brothers.Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.92,0:11:12.27,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,No matter where we are or what we do, our bonds won't be broken!Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:17.98,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,So from now on, we're...Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.78,0:11:19.91,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,brothers!Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.36,0:11:27.86,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.54,0:11:38.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you alright, Sabo?Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.94,0:11:52.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.77,0:11:53.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:57.14,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That's right...Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.54,0:12:01.82,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This dead guy wasn't just some random pirate...Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:11.98,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He wasn't just some threat in the Pirate Era that needed to be eliminated!Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.38,0:12:18.33,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Ace is my...Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.20,0:12:21.18,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,brother!Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:37.14,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I won't run from, or lose to anyone!Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.20,0:12:47.17,Main,,0,0,0,,The Chief of Staff''s awake!Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.17,0:12:49.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Really? What a relief!Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.02,0:13:02.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought you were gonna die, Sabo-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:06.42,Main,,0,0,0,,You had quite a high fever, Sabo.Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.06,0:13:09.65,Main,,0,0,0,,You were asleep for three days straight!Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.65,0:13:12.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I was so worried!Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:19.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? You've got your memory back?Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.78,0:13:24.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I remember everything now.Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.94,0:13:30.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Including who I am and why I left home and sailed out to sea.Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.66,0:13:35.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. Good for you.Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.98,0:13:38.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna quit the Revolutionary Army, then?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.94,0:13:44.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Nope, no way.Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.46,0:13:49.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Is Dragon-san still here?Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.29,0:13:49.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.48,0:13:53.03,Main,,0,0,0,,There's something I want to talk about.Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.86,0:14:12.44,Main,,0,0,0,,At that moment, I felt Ace say to me,Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.44,0:14:16.38,Main,,0,0,0,,"You're Sabo. You're brothers with me and Luffy."Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.56,0:14:43.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Finally... I've managed to come this far, Ace.Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.46,0:14:46.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Check it out.Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.70,0:14:51.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy's started on his way again to become the Pirate King.Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.06,0:14:54.28,Main,,0,0,0,,That's our little brother for you!Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:55.58,Note,,0,0,0,,Headline: The Straw Hats Are BackDialogue: 0,0:15:16.80,0:15:17.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo-kun?Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.92,0:15:20.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I want you to ask a favor of the entire Revolutionary Army.Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.04,0:15:23.86,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a Devil Fruit that I need to acquire, no matter the cost.Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.70,0:15:27.62,Main,,0,0,0,,But, but Luffy-senpai...Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.93,0:15:27.50,Captions,,1000,0,320,,DressrosaDialogue: 0,0:15:27.62,0:15:29.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What about the Flame Fruit?Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.42,0:15:32.54,Main,,0,0,0,,There's someone I really don't want to have it, but I got no choice.Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.54,0:15:34.55,Main,,0,0,0,,My friends' lives are more important.Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.48,0:15:40.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah'll definitely get ya the Flame Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.97,0:15:43.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Just go do whatever it was ya needed to!Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.55,0:15:45.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Really? Thanks a bunch!Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.92,0:15:54.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you have the Flame Fruit...Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:16:00.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.40,0:16:03.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey! Who're you?Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.97,0:16:07.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Why're you just casually talking to Luffy-senpai like that?Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.32,0:16:12.67,Main,,0,0,0,,He's the younger brother of that legendary pirate, Fire Fist Ace-sama,Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.67,0:16:16.77,Main,,0,0,0,,and the future Pirate King, you dumbass!Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.77,0:16:19.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I've known that for a long time.Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.16,0:16:29.51,Main,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.51,0:16:32.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Just showing up outta nowhere and telling me you won't let me have the Flame Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:43.44,Main,,0,0,0,,It's me, Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.00,0:16:47.63,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "It's me"?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.63,0:16:50.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Get this! The Flame Fruit is a keepsake of Ace's!Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.94,0:16:52.20,Main,,0,0,0,,If you want it, we're enemies!Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.20,0:16:55.75,Main,,0,0,0,,And as for you calling me "Luffy"...Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.75,0:16:57.49,Main,,0,0,0,,See this beard?Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.49,0:16:59.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:03.30,Main,,0,0,0,,You really think I wouldn't know my little brother's face behind that disguise of his?Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.88,0:17:05.41,Main,,0,0,0,,"Little brother"?Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.41,0:17:08.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Look here, the only people allowed to call me "little brother"...Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.15,0:17:09.57,Main,,0,0,0,,are Ace, who's dead, and...Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.57,0:17:11.31,Main,,0,0,0,,a guy who died way earlier...Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.00,0:17:29.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:35.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't be him!Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.62,0:17:43.40,Main,,0,0,0,,We stole a bottle of sake from Dadan and made a toast...Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.98,0:17:51.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo!Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:04.77,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell?! Where have you been this whole time?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.77,0:18:07.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought you were dead!Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.68,0:18:13.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.00,0:18:17.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you lived!Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.84,0:18:26.72,Main,,0,0,0,,But Sabo, I...Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.72,0:18:30.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I let Ace be killed right in front of me...Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.72,0:18:34.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I know. Even though Ace died, I'm...Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.98,0:18:37.74,Main,,0,0,0,,so happy that you survived!Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.80,0:18:42.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I almost lost both of my brothers without being able to do a thing!Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.22,0:18:48.58,Main,,0,0,0,,If you'd died too, I would've been left on my own!Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.12,0:19:07.43,Main,,0,0,0,,So, thanks!Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.14,0:19:13.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for staying alive, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.48,0:19:25.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it alright if I eat the Flame Fruit?Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.70,0:19:29.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.60,0:19:34.07,Main,,0,0,0,,That'd be great! Nobody else can have it!Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.46,0:19:45.00,Main,,0,0,0,,That darn Luffy... He's smiling!Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.58,0:19:48.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Makes you wonder what he's dreaming about.Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.50,0:19:53.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm off.Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.39,0:19:54.36,Main,,0,0,0,,So soon?Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.36,0:19:55.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I got to see his face, so...Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.95,0:19:59.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Here, I had a Vivre Card made from Luffy, just in case.Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.63,0:20:02.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? When'd you have time for that?Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.22,0:20:03.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking a piece.Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.20,0:20:09.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright. Luffy may be a bit of a handful,Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.35,0:20:10.74,Main,,0,0,0,,but please take good care of him.Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:15.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! You can count on us!Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.82,0:20:22.18,Main,,0,0,0,,He and Ace said the same thing.Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.50,0:20:30.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo, that you? Hack here.Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.71,0:20:33.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I just left. I'll be back soon.Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.74,0:20:35.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger that.Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.02,0:20:38.28,Main,,0,0,0,,So, how'd it go? Luffy-kun was quite...Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:44.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Why'd he hang up?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.67,0:20:45.66,Main,,0,0,0,,That selfish jerk!Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.44,0:20:47.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa there, Hack-san!Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.64,0:21:04.37,Main,,0,0,0,,We're all set to depart, right?Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.37,0:21:06.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, anytime.Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.27,0:21:07.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright!Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.38,0:21:11.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Once we return to Baltigo, there's so much I have to tell Dragon-san about Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.56,0:21:15.16,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I really am...Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.16,0:21:17.22,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,glad I got to see him again.Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.74,0:21:19.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's move out!Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.05,0:21:29.90,Captions,,50,0,340,,DressrosaDialogue: 0,0:21:33.42,0:21:37.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it? Could you look for me?Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.54,0:21:38.48,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a "one".Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.08,0:21:43.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. The only side that would be in Straw Hat's favor...Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.61,0:21:45.46,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what we agreed upon, yes?Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.46,0:21:47.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is, but...Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.12,0:21:50.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, he won this one.Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.98,0:21:54.19,Main,,0,0,0,,We shan't arrest him tonight.Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.19,0:21:56.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't determine that just by a roll of the die, Isshou-san!Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.96,0:22:01.19,Main,,0,0,0,,We ran all over the entire country and finally found out where he is!Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.19,0:22:04.27,Main,,0,0,0,,After all the disrespect you showed Fleet Admiral Sakazuki...Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.27,0:22:07.63,Main,,0,0,0,,If we want to take down Law and Straw Hat, now's our chance!Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.63,0:22:09.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Maynard-san!Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.96,0:22:15.18,Main,,0,0,0,,A man ought not complain after the die is cast.Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.74,0:22:18.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Quite pathetic of you, really.Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.31,0:22:23.23,Captions,,0,0,180,,Royal PalaceDialogue: 0,0:22:23.52,0:22:26.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Has anyone seen Lucy after all that?Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.66,0:22:28.01,Main,,0,0,0,,No, nobody did.Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.01,0:22:29.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I just wanna thank him!Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.56,0:22:31.71,Main,,0,0,0,,There's already quite a fuss out there.Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.71,0:22:34.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if they truly are pirates or criminals,Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.69,0:22:38.22,Main,,0,0,0,,they're unquestionably our saviors.Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.76,0:22:45.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Grandfather!Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.18,0:22:48.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca.Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.60,0:22:52.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Father, Lucy, and the others aren't here at the Palace!Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.08,0:22:57.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, don't worry about that. Kyros called.Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.30,0:22:59.18,Main,,0,0,0,,They're all together.Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.32,0:23:00.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.16,0:23:04.46,Main,,0,0,0,,That aside...Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.38,0:23:06.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca.Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.32,0:23:12.24,Main,,0,0,0,,If I were to return as king,Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:15.56,Main,,0,0,0,,that would make you a princess.Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.94,0:23:23.00,Captions,,0,0,335,,The Next Day The New World (The Twirly Hat Pirates)Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.42,0:23:33.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn!Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.72,0:23:37.56,Main,,0,0,0,,We finally shook off Big Mom's ship after all that trouble...Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.92,0:23:42.54,Main,,0,0,0,,So why would you get us into even more trouble?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.44,0:23:45.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You've no say in the matter!Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.96,0:23:46.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Do as you're told!Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.75,0:23:49.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm saying it for the sake of you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.90,0:23:52.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't stick your nose in their business!Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.70,0:23:57.69,Main,,0,0,0,,We should have waited patiently on the ship. You're pretty stupid to be rushing ahead like this!Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.69,0:24:00.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up and do what I tell you!Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.15,0:24:01.16,Main,,0,0,0,,You gonna do it?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.94,0:24:04.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Or would you rather I crush your heart?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.20,0:24:12.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Fine! But I won't forget this.Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.28,0:24:16.65,Main,,0,0,0,,It was the right call to come ashore!Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.65,0:24:21.34,Main,,0,0,0,,We can still save them! We need your help!Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.38,0:24:25.79,Main,,0,0,0,,In that case, why don't you treat me more nicely...Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.79,0:24:26.94,Main,,0,0,0,,You say something?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.92,0:24:30.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop threatening me with that!Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.28,0:24:31.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Caesar!Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.85,0:24:35.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop telling me what to do, you blasted raccoon dog!Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.04,0:24:38.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a reindeer!Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.08,0:24:40.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the difference?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.30,0:24:43.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Just hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.06,0:24:50.42,Main,,0,0,0,,If they die because of you, I'll make you pay for it!Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.46,0:24:54.68,Main,,0,0,0,,We need your help!Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.20,0:25:07.48,Main,,0,0,0,,It's hard to run here!Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.48,0:25:10.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we were separated from Sanji-san and the others.Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.90,0:25:11.98,Main,,0,0,0,,We're in trouble!Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.54,0:25:15.26,Main,,0,0,0,,We were too captivated by the mystery girl.Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.54,0:25:20.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, watch out, Nami-san!Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.90,0:25:23.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Watch out, me!Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.92,0:25:28.16,Main,,0,0,0,,No, how could you?! How could you?! How could you?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.22,0:25:34.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Onami, they are upon us!Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.52,0:25:41.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.02,0:25:59.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this it, invaders?Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.25,0:26:02.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where'd you hide that girl?Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.38,0:26:06.08,Main,,0,0,0,,How'd you guys make it onto this island?Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.94,0:26:10.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Answer me! This place is pretty hard to-Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.86,0:26:13.20,Main,,0,0,0,,What... what's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.20,0:26:14.80,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it this time?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.54,0:26:21.96,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a Rain-Ruption!Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.88,0:26:23.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Again?Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.76,0:26:26.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Get down!Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.40,0:26:31.23,Main,,0,0,0,,What is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.23,0:26:32.56,Main,,0,0,0,,"Rain"?Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.56,0:26:34.84,Main,,0,0,0,,That's way off! It's a deluge!Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.98,0:26:40.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I shall protect you no matter what!Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.38,0:26:49.62,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.28,0:26:51.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami-san!Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.38,0:26:54.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-san!Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.12,0:26:58.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Help me!Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.32,0:27:01.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Assist me, too!Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.05,0:27:01.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Geez!Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.91,0:27:04.42,Main,,0,0,0,,You Devil Fruit users are such pains in the butt!Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.42,0:27:08.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I couldn't protect you!Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.24,0:27:15.36,Main,,0,0,0,,You won't get away from me, you damned invaders!Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.64,0:27:30.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, pull yourself together!Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.60,0:27:33.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, as always.Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.67,0:27:35.39,Main,,0,0,0,,You too, Momo!Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.39,0:27:36.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I am in your debt.Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.96,0:27:43.08,Main,,0,0,0,,When in doubt...Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.08,0:27:44.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Just kill!Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.16,0:27:51.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook!Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.09,0:27:52.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Sir Bones!Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.24,0:27:55.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I finally managed to protect you!Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.20,0:28:00.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Please allow me to handle the rest!Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.78,0:28:04.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Tsk! How arrogant!Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.21,0:28:06.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Sheep's Horn!Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.80,0:28:11.23,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.23,0:28:12.66,Main,,0,0,0,,What are those arms?Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.66,0:28:13.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Sir Bones!Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.62,0:28:16.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Take this!Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.08,0:28:18.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Soul Parade!Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.78,0:28:25.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Sir Bones, that is amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.04,0:28:30.40,Main,,0,0,0,,What manner of ability is this?Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.18,0:28:35.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook!Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.48,0:28:37.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep stalling him!Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.92,0:28:41.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Diable Mouton...Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.94,0:28:43.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Shot!Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.98,0:28:57.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Sheepshead-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.48,0:29:00.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.41,0:29:03.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Nami-swan!Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.58,0:29:06.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you people?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.18,0:29:08.10,Main,,0,0,0,,And just who are you people...Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.16,0:29:11.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What? How creepy!Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.64,0:29:14.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Ginrummy-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.14,0:29:17.77,Main,,0,0,0,,You lot there! Retreat!Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.77,0:29:19.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Sheepshead-sama has been done in!Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.77,0:29:20.94,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.94,0:29:23.13,Main,,0,0,0,,But we haven't found the samurai yet!Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.13,0:29:26.27,Main,,0,0,0,,We've cornered them this far, and he still hasn't shown himself!Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.27,0:29:29.14,Main,,0,0,0,,"The samurai's not here." Tell him exactly that!Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.14,0:29:29.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.18,0:29:36.66,Main,,0,0,0,,The water's draining away...Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.22,0:29:40.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What was that all about, I wonder?Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.26,0:29:43.87,Main,,0,0,0,,It's certainly one strange island.Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.87,0:29:46.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I hope that girl's okay, too...Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.15,0:29:49.63,Main,,0,0,0,,She's more agile than we are. She'll be quite alright.Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.63,0:29:50.57,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right.Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.92,0:30:01.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.04,0:30:04.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Get over here right now!Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.82,0:30:08.08,Main,,0,0,0,,That be Chop'emon, in the lower forest!Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.08,0:30:10.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Then let's move out! There's no time to lose!Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.24,0:30:20.89,Captions,,0,0,175,,The Kid Pirates' Safe HouseDialogue: 0,0:30:31.44,0:30:32.66,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that noise?Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.66,0:30:39.02,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened?Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.02,0:30:42.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain, there's a massive hole!Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.25,0:30:43.47,Main,,0,0,0,,A hole?Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.47,0:30:44.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Something's landed!Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.22,0:30:47.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Take arms!Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.59,0:30:49.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.12,0:30:52.13,Main,,0,0,0,,That's it!Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.61,0:31:10.78,Main,,0,0,0,,It certainly is quite large.Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.44,0:31:13.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did it fall from?Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.25,0:31:15.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Just who in the hell caused this?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.18,0:31:19.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, doesn't it look human-shaped?Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.98,0:31:22.16,Main,,0,0,0,,If I recall correctly...Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.76,0:31:27.64,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a legend about a sky island where some monster lives...Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.86,0:31:31.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Somewhere in the sky, around here, right?Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.50,0:31:35.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me that it was pushed off of a sky island?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.54,0:31:38.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Kid!Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.42,0:31:42.45,Main,,0,0,0,,One of our ships was capsized by the impact!Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.45,0:31:43.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.96,0:31:47.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it all! Who did this?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.68,0:31:52.50,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The strong live, and the weak die.Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.46,0:31:56.64,Narrator,,0,0,0,,That is just how the world is.Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.70,0:32:00.88,Narrator,,0,0,0,,A few minutes ago...Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.30,0:32:07.80,Captions,,0,0,175,,Sky Island - The Ruins of Balloon TerminalDialogue: 0,0:32:14.90,0:32:17.06,Main,,0,0,0,,What exactly are you doing?Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.06,0:32:19.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Let us leave him be, High Priest!Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.29,0:32:20.98,Main,,0,0,0,,He must be insane!Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.98,0:32:24.72,Main,,0,0,0,,We're ten thousand meters up in the air.Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.72,0:32:29.12,Narrator,,0,0,0,,This man was looking for a place to die.Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.12,0:32:31.16,Main,,0,0,0,,If he's serious, why bother to stop him?Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.22,0:32:35.58,Narrator,,0,0,0,,To sum up his life,Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.58,0:32:39.18,Narrator,,0,0,0,,he had been defeated seven times as a pirate,Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.72,0:32:44.62,Narrator,,0,0,0,,and was captured by the Navy or his enemies eighteen times.Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.90,0:32:51.82,Narrator,,0,0,0,,He underwent torture repeatedly, and lived as a criminal.Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.86,0:33:03.91,Narrator,,0,0,0,,He wanted to commit suicide...Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.02,0:33:09.16,Narrator,,0,0,0,,in an extraordinary way by jumping off of a sky island.Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.50,0:33:16.37,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Hence, the current situation.Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.13,0:33:20.96,Narrator,,0,0,0,,It bears repeating:Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.96,0:33:24.10,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Single-handedly, he challenged the Navy and the Emperors,Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.10,0:33:28.59,Narrator,,0,0,0,,was captured eighteen times, and sentenced to death forty times.Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.26,0:33:33.28,Narrator,,0,0,0,,When hanged, the chain broke.Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.94,0:33:37.98,Narrator,,0,0,0,,When put under the guillotine, the blade shattered.Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.50,0:33:42.25,Narrator,,0,0,0,,When sentenced to impalement, the spear splintered.Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.19,0:33:47.56,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Consequently, he sank nine prison ships.Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.56,0:33:51.26,Narrator,,0,0,0,,In short, no one could kill him.Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.28,0:33:55.83,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And that included himself.Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.42,0:34:03.82,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it now?Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.78,0:34:22.14,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that monster?Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.77,0:34:26.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn, my head hurts.Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.38,0:34:30.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Guess it's hard to die.Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.28,0:34:32.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I survived again.Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.70,0:34:39.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed he pulled it off...Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.37,0:34:41.50,Main,,0,0,0,,That old man, Whitebeard.Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.52,0:34:58.31,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The man searching for his deathbed:Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.30,0:35:01.48,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Kaidou of the BeastsDialogue: 0,0:35:07.62,0:35:13.40,Narrator,,0,0,0,,People say, "If it's one-on-one, Kaidou will win."Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.54,0:35:24.29,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Whether on land, sea, or air, he is the pirate known as "the mightiest being alive".Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.52,0:35:31.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I've no choice, have I?!Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.20,0:35:46.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.70,0:35:49.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Joker!Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.91,0:35:54.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Make ready for the final battle!Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.10,0:36:00.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care if this boring world is laid to waste!Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.48,0:36:06.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's start the greatest war the world's ever seen!Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.46,0:36:09.50,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing:  Datenshi, Sewil (Opening)  Quality Assurance:  Datenshi, Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Mr. Luffy  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Translation: Yibis